Alembic migration environment.

`env.py` takes its URL from `app.core.config.settings.database_url` and its
target metadata from `app.db.base:Base.metadata` (with `app.models` imported so
every table is registered), so the CLI and the running app can never disagree.

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "what changed"   # review the file it writes
    alembic upgrade head
    alembic downgrade -1
    alembic check                                       # models vs. database drift

Tests can drive this environment against their own connection by setting
`config.attributes["connection"]` — see tests/unit/test_migrations.py.
